---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact PetWellHub" description="Contact PetWellHub about corrections, privacy, accessibility, or editorial questions">
  <article class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24"><header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">Contact</p><h1 class="mb-5 text-5xl font-bold md:text-7xl">Contact PetWellHub</h1><p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-foreground/70">Use the editorial address for corrections, source questions, privacy requests, and accessibility concerns.</p></header>
    <div class="mb-12 border-l-4 border-accent bg-muted/30 p-7"><p class="mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground">Editorial email</p><a class="text-2xl font-bold underline" href="mailto:editor@petwellhub.org">editor@petwellhub.org</a></div>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
      <section><h2>Help us investigate efficiently</h2><p>Include the page URL, the specific passage or image, why it may be inaccurate or unsafe, and a supporting source if available. Do not send passwords, payment details, or unnecessary medical records.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Veterinary emergencies</h2><p>This inbox is not monitored as an emergency service and cannot diagnose or treat a pet. Contact a local emergency veterinarian or an established animal poison-control service immediately for an urgent medical concern.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Professional input</h2><p>Veterinarians, veterinary technicians, researchers, regulators, and animal-welfare professionals may send a correction or offer relevant expertise. A message does not create an endorsement or guarantee publication.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Privacy and legal requests</h2><p>Use the same address for privacy requests, copyright concerns, and legal notices. Response time depends on scope, verification, urgency, and applicable law; PetWellHub does not promise a fixed response deadline.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
